#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
ztgw — Interactive CLI and Orchestrator for Zscaler Unified ZTGW (GCP & AWS).

Zero external dependencies (pure Python standard library).
Provides a modern, delightful CLI experience for first-time users, POCs,
and field engineers, on top of pure native Terraform.

Commands:
  ./ztgw configure   Interactive guided setup with topology selection (Dedicated, Shared, Hub-and-Spoke)
  ./ztgw plan        Run terraform plan for the selected cloud
  ./ztgw apply       Provision ZTGW + consumer VPC plumbing in one shot
  ./ztgw destroy     Cleanly tear down consumer plumbing and deprovision ZTGW
  ./ztgw output      Show Terraform outputs (Endpoint / IDG, egress IPs)
"""

